The distributed container image bundles third-party software under their
own licenses, including but not limited to:

  nmap             — Nmap Public Source License (NPSL), based on GPLv2
  iputils          — BSD-3-Clause / GPL-2.0-or-later
  traceroute       — GPL-2.0-or-later
  bind9-dnsutils   — MPL-2.0
  iproute2         — GPL-2.0-or-later
  Debian base OS   — various, see /usr/share/doc in the image

Python dependencies and their licenses are enumerated in the SBOM attached
to each published release image. Retrieve it with:

    docker buildx imagetools inspect ghcr.io/jjee33/netops-console:latest \
      --format '{{ json .SBOM }}'

